<BaseLayout title="Front brake pads">
  <h1>Front brake pad replacement notes</h1>
  <p>This page is a place to document the front brake pad job on the 2021 S60. Confirm the brake package, caliper design, pad shape, hardware, and service procedure by VIN before ordering parts or starting work.</p>
  <h2>Before starting</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Confirm the correct pads and any required hardware for the vehicle.</li>
    <li>Obtain the Volvo procedure and verify all torque specifications.</li>
    <li>Use an appropriate lifting point, rated jack stands, and wheel chocks on a level surface.</li>
    <li>Do not allow the caliper to hang from the brake hose.</li>
    <li>Inspect the rotor, caliper, guide components, dust boots, and brake hose.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Important</h2>
  <p>Do not rely on generic torque values or assume that all S60 brake configurations use the same components. After assembly, verify pedal firmness and perform the prescribed bedding procedure in a safe location.</p>
</BaseLayout>
